WEBVTT

00:09:58.260 --> 00:10:03.223
which in turn can look like adults
having safe, healthy,

00:10:03.265 --> 00:10:06.018
pleasurable and fun sex.

00:10:06.894 --> 00:10:10.731
Because consent isn't just about sex.

00:10:11.565 --> 00:10:15.653
It's first about communication
and relationships.

00:10:16.612 --> 00:10:17.780
Thank you.

00:10:17.821 --> 00:10:24.787
(Applause)